{
  "name": "Elminster’s Effulgent Spheres",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Six chromatic spheres orbit you for 1 hour (one more per slot level above 6; they're the spell's uses). <strong>Energy Blast</strong>: as a Bonus Action, make a ranged spell attack against a target within 120 ft - 3d6 Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning or Thunder damage; the sphere is spent either way. <strong>Absorb Energy</strong>: when you take Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning or Thunder damage, spend a sphere as a Reaction for Resistance to that type until the start of your next turn (offered automatically). The spell ends when no spheres remain.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
